{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_title", "source_sha256": "7752431b6edf60ac7a0024bca3a15fcc63b4926c982a5bfba11c8510186e56bc", "ja": "ここから、また！", "zh": "从这里，重新开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_synopsis", "source_sha256": "78189a61782bc8cd958b2138e2450b011d391854304028d49baaecfdd315fd0e", "ja": "年の瀬に行われる特別公演は、久しぶりの\n全員参加とあって、レッスンに準備にと\n余念がないアイドル達。プロデューサーは\n今年も来年も、こうしてアイドルのみんなと\n大切な日々を重ねられるようにと願う。", "zh": "在岁末举办的特别演出难得迎来全体成员齐聚一堂，\n偶像们全心投入到了课程与筹备工作中。\n制作人默默祈愿，无论今年还是来年，\n都能像这样与所有的偶像们一起，\n度过每一个珍贵而充实的日子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fe00ce10cdaf2aac9e5c8a3e3cb5405f63d63a37f50953d2d5fe7a0597234187", "ja": "（さて、みんなはどんな様子かな？\n確かこの時間は、茜達がレッスンをしているはず……）", "zh": "（那么，大家现在是什么情况呢？\n我记得这个时间，茜她们应该正在练习……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "4e605b84869ab92a9df8288c81b703fc32c1b204243398cd7e2a246637427004", "ja": "なーなー貴音！　こんなポーズどうかな？\n衣装の裾がふわっとするから、こう……。", "zh": "呐呐，贵音！这个姿势怎么样？\n因为服装的下摆会轻轻飘起来，所以要这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "ee966f4b390eb4896c24455bbd0b192b2e463f00227888221b3d264379a1e3f2", "ja": "素晴らしいです、昴。真、可愛らしく……\nでは私は、このようにいたしましょう。", "zh": "非常棒，昴。确实很可爱……那我就摆成这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "f9290d37eb5e6f980e4ceb785ad3cb38e91d8c7e5c6e05bb2045be3eb94ada0b", "ja": "おおー！　すっげー！\nカワイイって奥が深いんだなー！　美也はどう？", "zh": "哦哦——！好厉害——！\n原来“可爱”还真是博大精深啊——！美也觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "87d4c0dc2a8e6ab78b8fb11ff0f90bc299a92fb48d4f61f9d8719629d1a6149f", "ja": "そうですね～。それでは私は、パワフルに……\nむん！", "zh": "是这样呢～。那么我就来，活力满满地……\n嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "3f2163389487aac30ac1a5893284449521b1358eb4ef320fcbf6ad6f8b6fb484", "ja": "どうでしょう～。\nカッコよく、できているでしょうか～。", "zh": "怎么样～？\n看起来很帅气吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "11415a8dbfe7896cfd0fe28e1f26d67edad53516bb7c24335811059f04197815", "ja": "なるほど、その手がありましたか。\nでは私も……むん！", "zh": "原来如此，还有这一招啊。\n那么我也……哼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "cfc1002a315083ac7916e2bfc7c935646e74f43b77b90b49beb92fd4365b208c", "ja": "美也ちゃん、貴音ちゃん！　なんかちょっと\nボディビルみたいになってるけど、それでいいの！？", "zh": "美也、贵音！　感觉有点变成健美运动了，这样真的没问题吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "3a7fd7e876361d902030043703dce096563545f30a10e52f51b4ac026ebdc552", "ja": "はて、ぼでぃーびる……？", "zh": "咦，健美……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "387630424d25abe21adb13f6d53bf681353df35cdfbfbec823346038fbe4cd00", "ja": "ほら、筋肉ムキムキの人がやってるやつだよ。\nカッコイイ感じでさ！　キレてるぞー、貴音！", "zh": "你看，就是肌肉特别发达的人做的那种。\n感觉很帅气！线条真漂亮——贵音！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "3e8000aa9d8dc7cd2a8c8838b2ac90278e1900165b312bc477c6966adbb5ebcd", "ja": "キレがある、ということですか。\nでは、もう一度……むんっ！！", "zh": "是说很有干劲的意思吗？\n那么，再来一次……嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "6605fc4e43b48dcdaaa95bbb8b80617737cbcba18022a6ddf56e0b354b79582b", "ja": "おー、これは負けていられませんなー。\nでは私も……むーん！！", "zh": "哦——这可不能输啊——。  \n那我也……嗯——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "8ef8e3261d9d8a80077a8f4a7846f7473ce66fbd20ae8f41a5dcb4c5bb261d28", "ja": "すっげー！　美也、腕にちっちゃいバイク\n乗せてんのかーい、なんてな！　ははは！", "zh": "好厉害！美也，你手臂上放着一辆小摩托吗——！开玩笑的啦！哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "75291be20f2d4632bd6567c5ab70a8a624a2fde282bb6607fbc75df290edb7d1", "ja": "いやいやいや！　公演はボディビル大会じゃないよ！？\nもっと可愛くしようよ、みんな……！", "zh": "不不不！演出又不是健美比赛吧！？\n大家再可爱一点嘛……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "88d4a56b01f4083ad7789e242a12b13f04f09b4204185cf3bea1aa6cb9176b7b", "ja": "えー？　じゃあ茜、お手本見せてよ！", "zh": "诶——？那茜就给大家做个示范吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "5fdbb7128955822367d53f05bf79ec9bc23cf185f2294350b5b7236c572608d1", "ja": "え！？　じゃ、じゃあ茜ちゃんはこう……\nにゃっ♪", "zh": "诶！？那、那就让小茜这样……\n喵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "71a533f0714eceb93a9a3c5d4918e620eb461a41d2dfe4a74aa53ff034344146", "ja": "おお～。頭に猫耳乗せてんのかーい、\nということですな～。むふふ。", "zh": "哦哦～原来是把猫耳顶在头上啊——，是这么回事嘛～。嘻嘻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "5d190287f5ddd0d20f6cbbf2a59da83401f70992c32dcc04fc71f26be160f2b7", "ja": "ねえ、そのノリやめようよ！　ねえ！", "zh": "喂，别再这样跟着起哄了！喂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "15a036e0421ddfaf5b07513ba7e531471f31bae3cbf95524822bce194b9eb148", "ja": "むん！　にゃっ！", "zh": "唔！喵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "1d15bcd4bbf725f311c56c7aca685c1bbbbaa6554023018dd5e803e81462ab8e", "ja": "貴音、合わせ技か！　やるじゃん！\nじゃあ、こういうのはどう？　ほりゃー！", "zh": "贵音，原来还能组合起来用啊！真有你的！\n那这个怎么样？看招——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "5dfeefdc6a90aace46bacae328e005518c03226dc887f54fb70a8bb71f53923a", "ja": "な、なんじゃそりゃー！　はあ、はあ……\n茜ちゃん、ツッコミ疲れてきたよ……。", "zh": "那、那是什么鬼啊——！哈、哈……\n小茜，吐槽得我都开始累了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "9a0bf8f1c20c6021fee7939a943dd1ed329ff580d88eb143ea2f8c7b75c86150", "ja": "あはは！", "zh": "啊哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1022_008tak", "source_sha256": "dbc78ca5d65302a8b38bec657661270c58ae9fac943c1c718a7fa71c2d75ec30", "ja": "ふふっ。", "zh": "呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "2554ab683d45202054fc4fb4ef2201e974125b359b14faf4e5bd43880511e70f", "ja": "ふふふ。", "zh": "呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1024_p", "source_sha256": "b9771f8ec5767b3a54421edfea9f8599067ce3b2e2029e170c3357c1f968424d", "ja": "（……うん、楽しそうにやっているな！\nじゃ、次は……飾りつけ班の様子を見に行くか）", "zh": "（……嗯，看起来大家干得挺开心的！\n那么，接下来……去看看装饰组的情况吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "c300dc47528199edc7fb001bfb87132db49f6000e93ef3a42f0bd0135394e750", "ja": "あれ？　あれ？　うまくいかない……。\nあー！　細かい作業苦手ーっ！！", "zh": "咦？咦？进展得不顺利……  \n啊——！我不擅长这种细致活——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "f260c5414fa111139b85f1a85b67b04350d6869a333fc17a281ddffc5ac6af0b", "ja": "海美ちゃん、何事も根性なのです。\n根性さえあればなんでもできるのです。", "zh": "海美，要做好任何事都得靠毅力哦。\n只要有毅力，什么都能做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "2f18e666feb1466316a7551abe28f3d77247591d59f350161ab17c830cf265b8", "ja": "根性！？　それなら私もできそう！\nえーっと、根性ファイヤー！", "zh": "毅力！？那样的话，我好像也能做到！\n呃——毅力火焰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1029_null", "source_sha256": "078ce8f8f49b606db50910018a24a982ac9c07450accfb512dadb3808a5f1e07", "ja": "（ごきゃっ）", "zh": "（咔嚓！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1030_045kar", "source_sha256": "1f738bf43023bca4487c131fbf213b8c36bf841940ad10684e6706fcf4e6d384", "ja": "あっ、か、飾りが……。", "zh": "啊，装、装饰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1031_031tom", "source_sha256": "ae8d5533b3ccbd9f0c8e82a3065055f20f436b371053ee27a7d1ccfcf38d867b", "ja": "まつりさん～？　海美さんに、\n変なことを教えないでくれますか～？", "zh": "茉莉小姐～？能不能别教海美奇怪的东西啊～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "601de2db0b0f7e14bfe6cf0c284e12d48eb7a0716e90c6bf211a549cac801ee6", "ja": "ほ？　姫は何も間違ってないのです。", "zh": "咦？公主什么都没做错哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1033_031tom", "source_sha256": "0224a8e88f9ef3f82abc05308b697457a6a7da242a4725a8d6f92a3179281458", "ja": "間違っています～。飾りが壊れてしまったのが、\nその証拠ですよ～♪", "zh": "你说错了～。装饰坏掉了，就是证据哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1034_021mat", "source_sha256": "df5e1d8c625f07ad2a3b00f62ff8b36eb99ded10d0e0cbf5f2b5eb0fbbbfb8a5", "ja": "ほ？　ほ？　やるのです？　やるのです？", "zh": "哦？哦？要动手吗？要动手吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1035_031tom", "source_sha256": "55f92b2bd67612bd25e39aa9a31becc0161b107b14f76ba2752282509779be4f", "ja": "ふふふ～。お望みとあらば～♪", "zh": "呵呵呵～。既然是您所愿～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1036_null", "source_sha256": "a00dcfee7043f394e3e1e67bfa5042a30d3e3fd0ecfddbf9433efcf05dd6d02f", "ja": "（ゴゴゴゴゴゴゴ……）", "zh": "（轰轰轰轰轰轰轰……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1037_045kar", "source_sha256": "641a8590fdd5496cf42d66624262425a653edb7e7e13d7c26831a20cdb21a274", "ja": "ひっ……！　怖いオーラが、ふ、ふたりから出て……\nう、海美ちゃん、助けて……！", "zh": "呀……！好、好可怕的气场，从、从两个人身上冒出来了……\n海、海美，救救我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1038_029umi", "source_sha256": "d19718cb113df6e2cd91db061fd18d285c49e71b79d0c172d6d8e5945fc7dfc6", "ja": "根性、根性……ブツブツ。", "zh": "毅力，毅力……（喃喃自语）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1039_045kar", "source_sha256": "a4f28249563280e285c72e5ba7f4079c8b53332f0b95a713341784dad37a662c", "ja": "ううっ、海美ちゃんが自分の世界に\n入っちゃってる……！　こ、こうなったら私が……！", "zh": "呜呜，海美已经沉浸在自己的世界里了……！既、既然这样，那就由我来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
