{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1045_031tom", "source_sha256": "1012ca4b0c9d2d28b88b7a5af387bdc47eb8b39e2984f1436b4fcf67e967ff32", "ja": "まつりさん、いつでもかかってきてください～♪", "zh": "茉莉小姐，随时放马过来吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1046_021mat", "source_sha256": "dcf5b1947882c0deb71d006447b8fc4319eb5e4968de7f3e17b490bd69753c15", "ja": "そんなこと言っていいのです？　ほ？　ほ？", "zh": "说这种话真的好吗？　嗯？　嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
