{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1050_029umi", "source_sha256": "84b15c3ef3b2d2ee8f3aacda304e04070a9984f7e665be4d7d4736bc50c9c0e5", "ja": "みてみて！　根性を指先に集中させたら、\nすっごい綺麗にできたよ！", "zh": "快看快看！只要把毅力集中到指尖，\n就做得超级漂亮了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1051_029umi", "source_sha256": "ad6dc4fbaf3e2cd5414eb194b9eecf536f4733218c2cccb5a49e6bf3575f8426", "ja": "ほらほら、これも！　女子力トッピングで\n完璧的な！？　ねえみて、みんな！", "zh": "看吧看吧，这个也是！加上女子力的点缀，完美！？快看，大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
