{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1058_p", "source_sha256": "702ef5bc36e99c7e48b04933889a20be0bdcf6eb08dbc898084fa179c99276a0", "ja": "こらこら！　ふたりとも、争いは何も生まないぞ！\nそんなことより海美の作品、すごいな！　な！？", "zh": "喂喂！你们两个，争斗是不会带来任何结果的！\n先不说这个，海美的作品真厉害啊！对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1061_029umi", "source_sha256": "e7f6256c96220f4b062692df8c8c5c9287ff9fbe96a9fbac2bc9aa04f5d546e2", "ja": "あれ？　……どうしたの、ふたりとも？", "zh": "咦？……你们两个怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1062_021mat", "source_sha256": "16e877127f2b776dd93d3ae81cc096ed141ae8911b53c9b68a19b65e72a3b4ae", "ja": "……勝負は、お預けなのです。", "zh": "……胜负就先暂且搁置吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1063_031tom", "source_sha256": "46067373163daeb954c43b9d178e37d92ad5c69b0d73449ca560e4f7b97f7faf", "ja": "そういうことにしておきましょう。\n……今回は。", "zh": "就当是这么回事吧。\n……这次就这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1064_045kar", "source_sha256": "758da9a621a4e1a900083e9896b018481cef345f29ac797680d99527012e8d87", "ja": "ほっ……。", "zh": "呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1065_029umi", "source_sha256": "a64eef643c9c09aa8aa7600b4a60c8fde5fd131c281db7fc8bc5eeda166e7cbd", "ja": "さ、この調子でどんどん作っていくよー！\nお客さんたちも喜んでくれるハズ！", "zh": "好，就照这个劲头不断做下去吧——！\n客人们肯定也会很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1066_045kar", "source_sha256": "2ad36ee2927ad9a0dcbe554f0886a9a9c366bc71dd530b28e709886e0ef7c778", "ja": "そ、そうですね……！　\n作業に、し、集中しましょう……！", "zh": "是、是这样呢……！\n专、专心做手头的工作吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1067_021mat", "source_sha256": "aa9cf44ef5b741e81ddca1a0d48689acf852bde86c3087c01352d3ac0c67493f", "ja": "では、朋花ちゃん……\nどっちがキレイに早く作れるか、勝負なのです。", "zh": "那么，朋花……\n就比比看谁做得又漂亮又快吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1068_031tom", "source_sha256": "a1bc3bea269825bf4570e6c79caac291541af55cfca9c92d583316d092f4484b", "ja": "ふふ、そう来ると思ってました～。\n聖母の器用さ、なめないでくださいね～？", "zh": "呵呵，我就知道你会这么说～  \n可别小看圣母的手艺哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1069_045kar", "source_sha256": "1494605fe26b0c7982cd12ac4e0dc640e5b25ed3358141b95003466d96c9d050", "ja": "えっ、ま、まだ不穏……！？　う、うう……。\n{$P$}さん、どうしたら……。", "zh": "诶？还、还不妙吗……！？呜、呜呜……。\n{$P$}先生，该怎么办……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1070_p", "source_sha256": "ad9f86b67c39b29e6b8af48e2b5d9cddab63e4b211da441633c4f16c6788dab5", "ja": "まあ、少しならいいんじゃないかな……。ほら、\n仲間と高め合って、芸は磨かれていくものだし……。", "zh": "嗯，稍微来一点应该没关系吧……你看，和伙伴们相互切磋，才能不断磨炼技艺……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1071_null", "source_sha256": "6bfa14b96e3aeb5e149447901d3702a939b514a3782d4023b7357f031de94665", "ja": "（シュババババッ！！）", "zh": "（唰唰唰唰！！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1072_045kar", "source_sha256": "ec27e816b8cb092e8bec7b8cd0307fabc533867eca5745f3842d370cff5b2d03", "ja": "ひゃっ！？　ふたりとも、すごいスピード感！\nそれに、完成品のクオリティが、た、高いっ！", "zh": "呀！？你们两个的速度感也太强了吧！\n而且，成品的质量好、好高！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1073_029umi", "source_sha256": "2e592e6ae2425dd1301f2c9aefcc9ec12fbf4532752263c4d29637b86de49ffc", "ja": "わー、ふたりともすごいね！　そんなに、\nお客さんのことを思ってるなんて……感動した！", "zh": "哇——你们两个都好厉害啊！居然这么\n为客人们着想……太感动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1074_p", "source_sha256": "94d0f006569a44e776c7848fce71d2229528a96d24976d0f1142c9345453a8c7", "ja": "あ、ああ。そういうことにしておけば\nキレイにまとまるな、海美！", "zh": "啊，啊啊。就当是这么回事的话，也算是漂亮地收尾了，海美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1075_029umi", "source_sha256": "ce9648ffc9eda2a787fdcc1aa5f5693706687c6401a99a425a9a92e019e225af", "ja": "うんうん！　キレイは女子力の源！\nよーし、私も負けないぞー！", "zh": "嗯嗯！美丽可是女子力的源泉！  \n好——我也不会输的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1076_null", "source_sha256": "6bfa14b96e3aeb5e149447901d3702a939b514a3782d4023b7357f031de94665", "ja": "（シュババババッ！！）", "zh": "（唰唰唰唰！！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1077_045kar", "source_sha256": "76d31e94b3f8dc3339da1b22d0c92d83ff813a2f386bb3728553178f390b072a", "ja": "さ、3人ともすごい……！　ど、どうしよう、私……\nそんなに早くなんて……。", "zh": "3个人都好厉害……！我、我该怎么办……那么快什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1078_p", "source_sha256": "5c18f3e822635b9f6a328daa9376d7ae8803b8476659c7fc993afe88589b0fdf", "ja": "大丈夫、可憐は可憐のペースでやればいいさ。\n大事なのは、公演を成功させたいという気持ちだから。", "zh": "没事的，可怜只要按可怜自己的节奏来就行了。\n最重要的是想让公演取得成功的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1079_045kar", "source_sha256": "0e142f8e0f9a4c0d58c961542c1e9e2352011d4d80d8a379dcb5f6b45056aa2e", "ja": "気持ち……。そ、そうですね……！\nわ、私のペースで、がんばります……！", "zh": "心情……说、说得也是……！\n我、我会按照自己的节奏，加油的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1080_p", "source_sha256": "8888c364454b3769885e6742bddb42b5578e9be8e3bc4de43db81a4ddb8fdf80", "ja": "（ちょっと我ながら強引な結論に持って行って\nしまったが、まあいいだろう……）", "zh": "（虽然不知不觉把结论引向了一个连自己都觉得有些强硬的方向，不过嘛，这样也好……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_099_1081_p", "source_sha256": "c43e3d2c583166475625489e6a6b33e322d3c6cf6451028652b6c5684f716b67", "ja": "（みんながたくさんの思いを込めた公演……\nきっと、素晴らしい景色を見せてくれるはずだ！）", "zh": "（大家倾注了许多心意的公演……一定会让我们看到无比精彩的景色！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
